\f0\b\fs32 \cf4 \cb3 Hi everyone I am Harini Kesamneni, a rising senior concentrating in Entrepreneurship.\'a0
\f2\b0 \cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 Position:
\f2\b0 \'a0The Connector\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f0\b \cb3 Draft outlook:
\f2\b0 \'a0High trust, high energy, calm under pressure\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 SCOUTING SUMMARY\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f2\b0 \cb3 I lead with people. Put me in front of a client, a skeptical buyer, or a room full of strangers and I will find common ground fast. My other classroom is the stables: I compete in show jumping, a sport where you perform in front of judges with zero room for panic and commit fully once you are pointed at the fence. Hesitation is the only way to knock a rail, in riding and in business.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 GAME FILM\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f2\b0 \cb3 I do not just study real estate, I actually develop it. Back home in Andhra Pradesh I have run land acquisition and development projects end to end, including negotiating a 12 acre sale myself. Nothing teaches you people skills like sitting across from a buyer who thinks you are too young to be in the room.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 Through Project Destined I analyzed commercial deals worth over $50M, building and stress testing financial models in Excel.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 I also led a team of 5 students consulting a private client over 12 weeks, and once represented Asia as a data analyst at the UNICEF Student Summit.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 STRENGTHS\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f2\b0 \cb3 Speaking and selling. Whether it is pitching, presenting, or negotiating, I am at my best when the stakes involve people.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 Composure. Between show jumping and closing land deals, pressure feels familiar.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 GROWTH AREA\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f2\b0 \cb3 I sometimes keep the peace when I should push back. Learning that good teams need honest friction.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 LIKES\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f2\b0 \cb3 Show jumping, tango, meeting new people, teams that celebrate small wins.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 DISLIKES\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f2\b0 \cb3 Awkward silence in meetings, and "just send an email" when a five minute conversation would fix it.\cb1 \

\f0\b \cb3 WHY DRAFT ME:
\f2\b0 \'a0I have closed real deals with real money on the line. I bring that same energy, plus the people skills to keep a team talking, to whatever we build together.\cb1 \
